<title>UK: P&amp;G SAYS BUYS UNILEVER TEA UNIT.</title>
<headline>P&amp;G SAYS BUYS UNILEVER TEA UNIT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plantation &amp; General Investments Plc said on Wednesday it bought Sayama Tea Estates Ltd, the British holding company of Lujeri Tea Estates Ltd, from Unilever Plc for 2.8 million pounds.</p>
<p>Lujeri is based in Southern Malawi and manufactures 4.7 million kilogrammes of tea annually at two factories, P&amp;G said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Tony Roddam, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
